{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_17", "type": "agent_message", "text": "Grouping by start date placed all four tasks under “No start date,” and turning grouping off returned the same tasks in the active due date order. Sorting by title ascending also places the parent tasks alphabetically while keeping Pack for trip’s children nested under it. I’m moving on to search ranking and then will check subtasks, rotation, and persistence."}}
